<% pending_change = @resource.try(:unconfirmed_email?) %>
<% target_email = pending_change ? @resource.unconfirmed_email : @resource.email %>
<% content_for :email_footer_note, "This is a security notification sent to the email address associated with your Tax Form Hub account." %>
<%= pending_change ? "EMAIL ADDRESS CHANGE REQUESTED" : "YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS WAS CHANGED" %>

Hello <%= @email %>,

<% if pending_change %>
We're contacting you to notify you that your email address is being changed to <%= target_email %>.
<% else %>
We're contacting you to notify you that your email address has been changed to <%= target_email %>.
<% end %>

If you did not authorize this update, please sign in immediately or contact Tax Form Hub support:
<%= root_url %>
